| Extract   | $1                    | Direct webpage content extraction | 1s-3s (cached), 60s-90s (live) |</pre></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary mb-(--space-4) mt-(--space-16)">### Responses API</h3><div class="border not-machine:rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary border-stroke-primary"><header class="w-full flex items-center p-(--space-8) pl-(--space-16) border-b"><button class="ml-auto relative size-8 rounded-sm cursor-pointer not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay-invert transition-colors" data-state="closed"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay text-secondary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.98075 11.9931C2.32499 11.9931 1.83093 11.8253 1.49856 11.4897C1.16619 11.1494 1 10.646 1 9.97931V3.01379C1 2.34713 1.16619 1.84598 1.49856 1.51034C1.83093 1.17011 2.32499 1 2.98075 1H9.75168C10.4074 1 10.9015 1.17241 11.2339 1.51724C11.5662 1.85747 11.7324 2.35632 11.7324 3.01379V4.3931H10.9038V3.06207C10.9038 2.66207 10.8004 2.36092 10.5938 2.15862C10.3917 1.95172 10.1043 1.84828 9.73147 1.84828H3.00096C2.61919 1.84828 2.32724 1.95172 2.12512 2.15862C1.92749 2.36092 1.82868 2.66207 1.82868 3.06207V9.93103C1.82868 10.331 1.92749 10.6345 2.12512 10.8414C2.32724 11.0437 2.61919 11.1448 3.00096 11.1448H4.65833V11.9931H2.98075ZM6.25505 15C5.5948 15 5.09849 14.8299 4.76612 14.4897C4.43375 14.1494 4.26757 13.6483 4.26757 12.9862V6.02069C4.26757 5.34943 4.43375 4.84598 4.76612 4.51034C5.09849 4.17471 5.5948 4.0069 6.25505 4.0069H13.0192C13.675 4.0069 14.1691 4.17701 14.5014 4.51724C14.8338 4.85747 15 5.35862 15 6.02069V12.9862C15 13.6437 14.8338 14.1425 14.5014 14.4828C14.1691 14.8276 13.675 15 13.0192 15H6.25505ZM6.26853 14.1448H12.999C13.3718 14.1448 13.6593 14.0437 13.8614 13.8414C14.068 13.6391 14.1713 13.3379 14.1713 12.9379V6.06897C14.1713 5.66897 14.068 5.36782 13.8614 5.16552C13.6593 4.95862 13.3718 4.85517 12.999 4.85517H6.26853C5.88675 4.85517 5.5948 4.95862 5.39269 5.16552C5.19506 5.36782 5.09625 5.66897 5.09625 6.06897V12.9379C5.09625 13.3379 5.19506 13.6391 5.39269 13.8414C5.5948 14.0437 5.88675 14.1448 6.26853 14.1448Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></button></header><div class="w-full px-0 text-mono text-body-sm overflow-x-auto min-h-(--space-80) text-primary"><pre class="p-(--space-16)">| Processor | Cost (per 1K requests) | Best for                                               | Latency | Basis     |
| --------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------- | --------- |
| Low       | $10                    | Simple fact-retrieval questions                        | ~5–10s  | Citations |
| Medium    | $50                    | Complex, multi-hop fact-retrieval                      | ~15–20s | Citations |
| High      | $250                   | Deep research requiring extensive search and synthesis | ~30–60s | Citations |</pre></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary mb-(--space-4) mt-(--space-16)">### Monitor API</h3><div class="border not-machine:rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary border-stroke-primary"><header class="w-full flex items-center p-(--space-8) pl-(--space-16) border-b"><button class="ml-auto relative size-8 rounded-sm cursor-pointer not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay-invert transition-colors" data-state="closed"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay text-secondary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.98075 11.9931C2.32499 11.9931 1.83093 11.8253 1.49856 11.4897C1.16619 11.1494 1 10.646 1 9.97931V3.01379C1 2.34713 1.16619 1.84598 1.49856 1.51034C1.83093 1.17011 2.32499 1 2.98075 1H9.75168C10.4074 1 10.9015 1.17241 11.2339 1.51724C11.5662 1.85747 11.7324 2.35632 11.7324 3.01379V4.3931H10.9038V3.06207C10.9038 2.66207 10.8004 2.36092 10.5938 2.15862C10.3917 1.95172 10.1043 1.84828 9.73147 1.84828H3.00096C2.61919 1.84828 2.32724 1.95172 2.12512 2.15862C1.92749 2.36092 1.82868 2.66207 1.82868 3.06207V9.93103C1.82868 10.331 1.92749 10.6345 2.12512 10.8414C2.32724 11.0437 2.61919 11.1448 3.00096 11.1448H4.65833V11.9931H2.98075ZM6.25505 15C5.5948 15 5.09849 14.8299 4.76612 14.4897C4.43375 14.1494 4.26757 13.6483 4.26757 12.9862V6.02069C4.26757 5.34943 4.43375 4.84598 4.76612 4.51034C5.09849 4.17471 5.5948 4.0069 6.25505 4.0069H13.0192C13.675 4.0069 14.1691 4.17701 14.5014 4.51724C14.8338 4.85747 15 5.35862 15 6.02069V12.9862C15 13.6437 14.8338 14.1425 14.5014 14.4828C14.1691 14.8276 13.675 15 13.0192 15H6.25505ZM6.26853 14.1448H12.999C13.3718 14.1448 13.6593 14.0437 13.8614 13.8414C14.068 13.6391 14.1713 13.3379 14.1713 12.9379V6.06897C14.1713 5.66897 14.068 5.36782 13.8614 5.16552C13.6593 4.95862 13.3718 4.85517 12.999 4.85517H6.26853C5.88675 4.85517 5.5948 4.95862 5.39269 5.16552C5.19506 5.36782 5.09625 5.66897 5.09625 6.06897V12.9379C5.09625 13.3379 5.19506 13.6391 5.39269 13.8414C5.5948 14.0437 5.88675 14.1448 6.26853 14.1448Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></button></header><div class="w-full px-0 text-mono text-body-sm overflow-x-auto min-h-(--space-80) text-primary"><pre class="p-(--space-16)">| Processor | Cost (per 1K requests) | Best for                                                 | Frequency               | Basis     |
| --------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | --------- |
| Lite      | $3                     | Narrow queries — a single entity, domain, or signal type | Hourly / Daily / Weekly | Citations |
| Base      | $10                    | Wide queries — entity classes, topic areas, regions      | Hourly / Daily / Weekly | Citations |</pre></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-body-md font-medium text-secondary mb-(--space-4) mt-(--space-16)">### Find All API</h3><div class="border not-machine:rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary border-stroke-primary"><header class="w-full flex items-center p-(--space-8) pl-(--space-16) border-b"><button class="ml-auto relative size-8 rounded-sm cursor-pointer not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay-invert transition-colors" data-state="closed"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center not-machine:hover:bg-surface-overlay text-secondary"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.98075 11.9931C2.32499 11.9931 1.83093 11.8253 1.49856 11.4897C1.16619 11.1494 1 10.646 1 9.97931V3.01379C1 2.34713 1.16619 1.84598 1.49856 1.51034C1.83093 1.17011 2.32499 1 2.98075 1H9.75168C10.4074 1 10.9015 1.17241 11.2339 1.51724C11.5662 1.85747 11.7324 2.35632 11.7324 3.01379V4.3931H10.9038V3.06207C10.9038 2.66207 10.8004 2.36092 10.5938 2.15862C10.3917 1.95172 10.1043 1.84828 9.73147 1.84828H3.00096C2.61919 1.84828 2.32724 1.95172 2.12512 2.15862C1.92749 2.36092 1.82868 2.66207 1.82868 3.06207V9.93103C1.82868 10.331 1.92749 10.6345 2.12512 10.8414C2.32724 11.0437 2.61919 11.1448 3.00096 11.1448H4.65833V11.9931H2.98075ZM6.25505 15C5.5948 15 5.09849 14.8299 4.76612 14.4897C4.43375 14.1494 4.26757 13.6483 4.26757 12.9862V6.02069C4.26757 5.34943 4.43375 4.84598 4.76612 4.51034C5.09849 4.17471 5.5948 4.0069 6.25505 4.0069H13.0192C13.675 4.0069 14.1691 4.17701 14.5014 4.51724C14.8338 4.85747 15 5.35862 15 6.02069V12.9862C15 13.6437 14.8338 14.1425 14.5014 14.4828C14.1691 14.8276 13.675 15 13.0192 15H6.25505ZM6.26853 14.1448H12.999C13.3718 14.1448 13.6593 14.0437 13.8614 13.8414C14.068 13.6391 14.1713 13.3379 14.1713 12.9379V6.06897C